Foxfin
======

Foxfin is a modified version of Moonfin (https://github.com/Moonfin-Client/Moonfin-Core),
a Jellyfin & Emby client by the Moonfin contributors, which itself derives from
the Jellyfin Android TV project. Foxfin is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Moonfin, Jellyfin or Emby.

